{
 "schema": "artifacts/1",
 "title": "Markdown",
 "theme": "default",
 "defaultView": "main",
 "data": {
  "transforms": {
   "md": {
    "jsonata": "{\"prompt\": \"Réponds en {{langue}}, sur un ton {{ton|neutre}}.\\n\\n```\\n{{texte}}\\n```\\n\", \"vars\": {\"langue\": \"français\"}}"
   }
  }
 },
 "views": [
  {
   "id": "main",
   "title": "Markdown",
   "root": {
    "nodes": [
     {
      "tagName": "div",
      "attributes": {
       "style": "display:grid;gap:24px;padding:24px;max-width:760px;margin:auto"
      },
      "nodes": [
       {
        "tagName": "sonic-markdown",
        "attributes": {
         "id": "doc",
         "text": "# Guide rapide\n\nUn paragraphe **gras**, *italique*, ~~barré~~, `code` et un [lien](https://concorde.supersoniks.org).\n\n## Liste\n\n- un\n- [x] fait\n- [ ] à faire\n\n| Nom | Valeur |\n| :-- | -----: |\n| a | 1 |\n\n```ts\nconst total: number = 1 + 2;\n```\n\nFormule $E = mc^2$.\n\n<script>alert(1)</script> [piège](javascript:alert(1))\n",
         "features": "gfm highlight math copy anchors toc",
         "out-data-provider": "docState"
        }
       },
       {
        "tagName": "sonic-markdown",
        "attributes": {
         "id": "prompt",
         "source": "md.prompt",
         "vars": "md.vars",
         "features": "gfm vars copy",
         "out-data-provider": "promptState"
        }
       },
       {
        "tagName": "sonic-markdown",
        "attributes": {
         "id": "flux",
         "source": "flux.answer",
         "streaming": "",
         "features": "gfm",
         "out-data-provider": "fluxState"
        }
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  }
 ]
}